Package: mcp-server-filesystem
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends:
 python3-fastmcp,
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${python3:Depends},
Description: MCP server exposing Linux filesystem operations
 An MCP (Model Context Protocol) server exposing Linux filesystem
 operations as tools for an LLM agent, built on fastmcp.
 .
 Tools cover directory listing, file reading, stat, existence checks,
 and glob search (all read-only by default), plus file writes, mkdir,
 delete, move, and copy, gated behind FS_READONLY=false. All paths are
 confined to FS_ROOT, read once from the environment at startup.

Package: mcprack-mcp-server-filesystem
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 mcprack (>= 1.5.1),
 mcp-server-filesystem (= ${binary:Version}),
Description: Registers Filesystem MCP server into mcprack catalog
 Companion package for mcp-server-filesystem. Installing it registers
 the mcp-server-filesystem binary as an available MCP server in the
 local mcprack instance; removing it unregisters it again.
